# Phase 8 — CI/CD Automation + Power BI Analytics

## 1. Overview

Phase 8 is the final phase of the **Private Cloud Data Warehouse Platform**.

The objective of this phase is to automate the complete application lifecycle from source-code changes to deployment on the private K3s cluster and provide a business-intelligence layer using Microsoft Power BI.

The final pipeline connects:

```text
Developer
   │
   ▼
GitHub Repository
   │
   ▼
GitHub Actions
   │
   ├── Test
   ├── Validate
   ├── Build Docker Image
   ├── Push Image
   │
   ▼
Container Registry
   │
   ▼
K3s Private Cloud
   │
   ├── PostgreSQL
   ├── ETL
   └── Data Warehouse
   │
   ▼
Power BI
   │
   ▼
Analytics Dashboard
```

This phase transforms the project from a manually deployed data warehouse into a more complete **cloud-native private data platform**.

---

# 2. Phase 8 Objectives

The major objectives are:

1. Automate testing using GitHub Actions.
2. Validate the ETL pipeline before deployment.
3. Build Docker images automatically.
4. Push container images to a container registry.
5. Deploy updated containers to the K3s cluster.
6. Verify successful Kubernetes deployment.
7. Maintain reproducible deployments.
8. Connect the warehouse analytics to Power BI.
9. Build dashboards from warehouse data.
10. Provide an end-to-end CI/CD workflow.

