# 17. Docker Image Creation

The ETL application can be containerized.

Example Dockerfile:

```dockerfile
FROM python:3.12-slim

WORKDIR /app

COPY requirements.txt .

RUN pip install --no-cache-dir -r requirements.txt

COPY . .

CMD ["python", "-m", "etl.pipeline"]
```

Build locally:

```bash
docker build -t datawarehouse-etl:latest .
```

List images:

```bash
docker images
```

Run locally:

```bash
docker run --rm datawarehouse-etl:latest
```

