# 18. Docker Image Tagging

Instead of using only `latest`, production-oriented workflows should use unique tags.

Example:

```bash
docker build \
  -t username/datawarehouse-etl:latest \
  -t username/datawarehouse-etl:v1.0.0 .
```

A Git commit SHA can also be used:

```bash
docker build \
  -t username/datawarehouse-etl:${GITHUB_SHA} .
```

This makes every deployment traceable to a specific source-code version.

