# 21. Kubernetes Deployment

The Kubernetes ETL deployment should reference the container image.

Example:

```yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment

metadata:
  name: datawarehouse-etl
  namespace: datawarehouse

spec:

  replicas: 1

  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: datawarehouse-etl

  template:

    metadata:
      labels:
        app: datawarehouse-etl

    spec:

      containers:

        - name: etl

          image: username/datawarehouse-etl:latest

          imagePullPolicy: Always

          envFrom:
            - configMapRef:
                name: datawarehouse-config
```

