# 36. Useful SQL Views for Power BI

Example daily return view:

```sql
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW vw_daily_returns AS
SELECT
    ticker,
    trade_date,
    close_price,
    LAG(close_price)
        OVER (
            PARTITION BY ticker
            ORDER BY trade_date
        ) AS previous_close
FROM fact_stock_prices;
```

Daily return calculation:

```sql
SELECT
    ticker,
    trade_date,
    close_price,
    previous_close,
    ((close_price - previous_close) / previous_close) * 100
        AS daily_return
FROM vw_daily_returns;
```

