# 37. Monthly Performance Query

Example:

```sql
SELECT
    ticker,
    DATE_TRUNC('month', trade_date) AS month,
    MIN(close_price) AS opening_value,
    MAX(close_price) AS closing_value
FROM fact_stock_prices
GROUP BY
    ticker,
    DATE_TRUNC('month', trade_date);
```

