# 56. Problem 6 — No Default Route

If K3s reports:

```text
no default routes found
```

check:

```bash
ip route
```

Expected to contain a default route similar to:

```text
default via 192.168.1.1 dev <interface>
```

Check interfaces:

```bash
ip addr
```

Check NetworkManager:

```bash
nmcli device status
```

Check connections:

```bash
nmcli connection show
```

